{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/gifsilvanispro.gif?t=1748165969\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/ing1.png?t=1748165969\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Silvanis is an atmospheric first-person exploration and psychological thriller game. Set in a dense, fog-covered forest, the game places players in an isolated environment where discovery, tension, and silence shape the experience. Your goal is simple: descend into the forest, follow the clues, and uncover the fate of your missing daughter.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/ing2.png?t=1748165969\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Every path, trace, and object may hold a clue, requiring players to observe carefully and interact meaningfully with their surroundings. A minimal interface, dark forest design, and dynamic environmental audio work together to create a deeply immersive sense of tension. Progress depends on environmental awareness and thoughtful observation. The journey is not only physical but also mental, as the forest reflects both mystery and memory.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/extras/ing3.png?t=1748165969\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754050?t=1748165969","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754050?t=1748165969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/808a71071fa26bf0025b127bcc2c9b95ef405d32/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748165969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754050/808a71071fa26bf0025b127bcc2c9b95ef405d32/c